// Tracy's strings over upstream's gateway dictionary (`src/i18n.ts`, zh + en), invariants I1/I2.
//
// Only what differs is here: the 33 keys Tracy adds (`tracy.*` for the sign-in door, and
// `gw.loginTooFrequent`) and the values Tracy rebrands from "dsh" / "DeepSeek Harness" to
// "Tracy" (14 in zh, 13 in en). Every other key reads upstream's text through upstream's `t`,
// so an upstream wording change arrives with the next upgrade instead of being shadowed here.
//
// The six other interface languages are data in `./locales/<id>.json` (the repository's
// `language` gate scans code files for Vietnamese, so translations cannot live in a `.ts` file).

